  "description": "Author insight alerts that notify when a trends, SQL, or funnel insight crosses a bound, changes sharply, or looks anomalous. Use when the user asks to alert on a metric or insight, get notified when a number drops or spikes, set up anomaly detection, or use the AI anomaly detector (the llm detector type). Covers choosing between threshold, relative change, statistical detector, and AI detector, previewing with alert-simulate before saving, the AI detector's credit cost and limits, the exact create payload, and delivery by email or Slack.",
